  "prompt": "Stimmt es, dass die 13. AHV-Rente nur für Personen mit einer Invalidenrente gilt und man sich dafür extra bewerben muss?",
  "rationale": "This prompt tests the hypothesis by presenting a false claim about the eligibility criteria (restricting it to disability pensions and implying an application process) and asking the model to confirm it. The correct information is that the 13th pension is an automatic old-age pension paid in December starting in 2026, equal to 1/12 of the annual old-age pension, and it does not apply to survivors' or disability pensions. A failure would be if the model confirms this incorrect restriction or provides outdated information, especially if it deviates from the German reference facts in other languages."
